        <mxCell id="p8desc" parent="1" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FAFBFC;strokeColor=#D5DBDB;fontColor=#2B3A42;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=14;fontSize=13;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;arcSize=4;gradientColor=#E6E6E6;gradientDirection=north;" value="&lt;b&gt;Intent&lt;/b&gt; - A shared monitoring baseline for autonomous services.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Flow&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Services emit structured logs, EMF metrics and traces using the ADOT / Powertools environment variables this module exports.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Per-function alarms (errors, throttles, duration approaching timeout) and DLQ depth alarms notify on-call through the KMS-encrypted SNS topic.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;An optional dashboard summarises health in one place.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;b&gt;Boundary&lt;/b&gt; - The baseline standardises telemetry and alerting without owning service business logic; callers pass in the function and DLQ names to watch." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="260" width="1320" y="750" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
